      "statement": "`create_deep_agent` assembles a LangGraph agent from caller tools, a selected backend, ordered Deep Agents middleware, and optional checkpointer, store, cache, context, and state schemas; the resulting graph is configured with recursion limit 9,999 and Deep Agents integration/version metadata.",
