      "statement": "`DeepAgentState.messages` uses a `DeltaChannel` with the local message reducer and snapshot frequency 50, reducing message checkpoint growth from O(N²) to O(N); graph construction passes an optional caller checkpointer through to LangChain rather than supplying a persistence implementation itself.",
